Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.31,0:01:03.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.13,0:01:09.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道人们在议论纷纷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know people are saying things --
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.12,0:01:14.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说关于你和萨沙的好话\N{\fnArial\fs30}nice things about you and Sasha, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.24,0:01:17.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.61,0:01:18.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.10,0:01:20.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于那晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}About the other night...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.63,0:01:23.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们觉得是你救了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}about how they're thinking you saved the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.44,0:01:28.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别被好话冲昏了头脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let it go to your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.87,0:01:31.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你也别介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, don't let it bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.01,0:01:35.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来你挺介意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems like it bothers you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.34,0:01:47.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在上面干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you doing up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.11,0:01:52.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底吃不吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna eat that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.77,0:01:54.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.53,0:01:57.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.54,0:01:59.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道她怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know she's pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.20,0:02:28.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,逆着毛刮  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Against the grain, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.99,0:02:32.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总是逆着毛刮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always against the grain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.05,0:03:12.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  闻起来真香\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, that smells good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.11,0:03:20.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想尝尝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want a taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.97,0:03:25.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.83,0:03:37.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他要的柠檬粉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's his damn lemonade.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.47,0:03:39.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我厨房里有一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had some in my kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.81,0:03:43.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丹妮斯喜欢喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Denise liked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.32,0:03:50.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.35,0:03:56.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回家去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.07,0:03:58.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.07,0:04:01.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.64,0:04:03.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.77,0:04:07.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我答应瑞克照看朱迪思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told Rick I would watch Judith.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.86,0:04:11.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.97,0:04:17.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.22,0:04:21.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要坐下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're about to sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.34,0:04:52.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还需要一套餐具\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need another setting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.35,0:05:19.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有今天一天了  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today and only today, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.21,0:05:22.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.37,0:05:27.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些子弹孔\N{\fnArial\fs30}All these bullet holes --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.96,0:05:31.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这船很快会进水\N{\fnArial\fs30}this'll take on water quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.56,0:05:38.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也许能到独木舟那\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can probably make it to the canoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.04,0:05:41.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.73,0:05:44.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to stay back...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.09,0:05:48.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要装作你没说那话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to pretend you didn't just say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.76,0:06:06.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我决心完成这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm seeing this through.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.71,0:06:07.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.78,0:06:35.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不再等你爸爸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not waiting for your dad anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.53,0:06:37.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道他在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where the hell he is,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.41,0:06:40.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但露西尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Lucille...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.72,0:06:46.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...is hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.52,0:06:55.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔  把面包卷递给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, pass the rolls...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.32,0:07:01.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麻烦你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.70,0:07:42.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.18,0:08:00.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh. Look at that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.24,0:08:02.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这么容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.38,0:08:06.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是个交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a transaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.23,0:08:08.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来情况很糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like shit,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.45,0:08:09.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说明你为之奋斗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means you fought for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.65,0:08:10.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽到了职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did your jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.00,0:08:14.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你懂道理  我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get it, and I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.93,0:08:16.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼根喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan likes that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.49,0:08:22.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听到这话很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's...good to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.34,0:08:25.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好好干\N{\fnArial\fs30}You play your cards right,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.30,0:08:27.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我会带你去我们住的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe I'll show you where we live.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.62,0:08:30.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我会给你买个三明治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'll buy you a sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.30,0:08:38.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我什么时候就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me when.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.91,0:08:42.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢看吗  长毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like watching, haircut?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.90,0:08:43.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.66,0:08:45.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.34,0:08:48.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该滚远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean to get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.34,0:08:50.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.94,0:09:28.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.39,0:09:34.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是神之国花园里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just some things from the Kingdom garden --
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.66,0:09:37.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一些油桃和苹果\N{\fnArial\fs30}some nectarines, some apples.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.64,0:09:39.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  我不需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. I am good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.61,0:09:41.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你可以照顾自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can fend for yourself, I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.06,0:09:43.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但新鲜果蔬不是你能随随便便...\N{\fnArial\fs30}but fresh produce isn't something you can just --
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.50,0:09:44.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.50,0:09:47.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.72,0:09:52.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以西结吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezekiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.66,0:09:54.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,显然  我说我想一个人待着时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, some people are having a hard time believing me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.91,0:09:57.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人很难相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I say I just want to be left alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.91,0:10:00.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的确是想让你一个人待着  我以后也会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I was trying to leave you alone, and I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.14,0:10:02.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你叫我进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you called me over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.41,0:10:05.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.80,0:10:06.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.74,0:10:07.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.37,0:10:10.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.56,0:10:11.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在你可以走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.24,0:10:16.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你变温柔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're going soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.27,0:10:18.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.23,0:10:29.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.03,0:10:31.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉打扰你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.16,0:10:34.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摩根  我没想到你也在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan, I-I didn't expect you to be here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.74,0:10:35.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来了挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.27,0:10:39.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实际上我想跟你俩聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to speak to you both, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.15,0:10:40.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是关于一件重要的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about something important.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.10,0:10:46.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就快到独木舟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost at the canoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.69,0:10:52.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进水进得太快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're taking on water quick, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.09,0:10:53.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.41,0:11:04.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克  左边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, on the left!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.81,0:11:36.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.75,0:11:55.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.98,0:12:03.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.96,0:12:04.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.18,0:12:07.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,待在独木舟里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay in the canoe!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.24,0:12:09.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can -- Just --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.78,0:12:11.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaron!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:14.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaron!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.44,0:12:24.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaron!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.35,0:12:31.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.98,0:12:32.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.28,0:12:36.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.07,0:12:37.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.74,0:13:11.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别靠着墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop hugging the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.34,0:13:13.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.12,0:13:17.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}God damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.10,0:13:23.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去把拖把和桶拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get a mop and another barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.81,0:13:25.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要留着这鬼东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're keeping this crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.73,0:13:27.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不需要吃这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have to eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.07,0:13:29.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老天  他超恨泡菜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus. He hates pickles.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.86,0:13:40.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明有钩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got hooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.80,0:13:42.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道他为啥不把它系上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why he didn't strap it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.61,0:13:45.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和他说了两次了  他个蠢货就是不听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told him twice. His stupid ass didn't listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.66,0:14:12.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(恭喜你赢了  但你还是输了)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.97,0:14:19.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是个输不起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bit of a sore loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.96,0:14:25.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来除了弹药其他东西他都还有剩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like the only thing he ran out of was ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.23,0:14:28.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得马上把这个弄回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get this back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.86,0:14:29.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.65,0:14:34.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他有桨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...he's got paddles.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.32,0:14:36.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再加上是顺风\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with the wind picking up,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.27,0:14:38.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,漂回岸边应该不用很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}it shouldn't take long to drift back to shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.91,0:14:41.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷静  冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy. Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.90,0:14:44.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来弄就好  把这玩意收回去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got it. Take this crap back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.92,0:14:46.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自己看着点路就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How 'bout, this time, you watch where you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.88,0:14:48.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了  别说他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on. Get off his back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.09,0:15:07.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, back there,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.18,0:15:11.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是说你做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean that you couldn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.48,0:15:14.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.16,0:15:19.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走了这么远  冒了这么大险\N{\fnArial\fs30}going this far, risking this much
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.99,0:15:21.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就为了给他们进贡\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get things for them --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.39,0:15:23.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很多人并不赞同这种做法\N{\fnArial\fs30}people don't agree with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.44,0:15:25.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如你也不情愿的话我是不会怪你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't blame you if you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.57,0:15:31.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时也在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.53,0:15:35.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我亲眼目睹了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw what happened on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.84,0:15:39.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们这么做是为了让大家活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we're doing is gonna keep people living.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.47,0:15:42.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get to do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.81,0:15:45.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论我们自身会遭遇什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}it doesn't matter what happens to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.85,0:15:48.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米恩琼不认同这种活法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michonne doesn't think this is living.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.03,0:15:54.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,选择这样的活法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, committing to a choice like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.62,0:15:57.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相比于我们之前的生活...\N{\fnArial\fs30}after living how we did --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.12,0:15:58.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自由的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}free --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.79,0:16:00.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我理解她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.39,0:16:03.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是很艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.88,0:16:07.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是放弃了除你生命以外的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's giving up everything, right up until your own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.47,0:16:13.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但只有这样你才能活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}But either your heart's beating, or it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.11,0:16:17.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爱的人才能活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your loved ones' hearts are beating, or they aren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.89,0:16:23.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们接受他们的条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take what they give us
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.93,0:16:25.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样我们才能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that we can live.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.26,0:17:03.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和尼根在一起多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how long you been with Negan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.44,0:17:12.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么独自一人在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why were you out there alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.10,0:17:16.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.38,0:17:31.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得即便你开口了也改变不了自己的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think talking won't change how this ends for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.54,0:17:33.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你不了解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you don't know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.98,0:17:39.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走着瞧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.62,0:17:58.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我今天不会去杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna kill him today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.64,0:18:02.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要找到一个能让我们取得胜利的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna find the way that we win.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.51,0:18:08.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要改变自己的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna change how this ends for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.89,0:18:12.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我独自一人在外的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I'm out here alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.13,0:18:22.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是苹果派吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that an apple pie?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.54,0:18:27.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh. How did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.05,0:18:28.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它还在门外我就闻到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could smell it from outside the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.87,0:18:31.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你烤的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you baked it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.45,0:18:34.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,某个人送给我们以表对我们所作所为的感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some guy gave it to us for what we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.00,0:18:37.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的小女儿说你应该去竞选山顶寨总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}His little girl said you should run for President of Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.07,0:18:39.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"支持玛姬当总统"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Maggie for President."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.64,0:18:48.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要碟子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, do you want a plate?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.13,0:18:49.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用  这样就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.05,0:18:53.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些是耶稣给你的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Jesus give you those?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.11,0:18:56.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还在这吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he still around?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.62,0:19:00.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趁他还没走  我想在他的单子上加几样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's some things I wanna add to his list before he goes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.61,0:19:02.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子们需要一些写字用的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kids need something to write with --
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.93,0:19:04.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水笔  铅笔\N{\fnArial\fs30}pens, pencils.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.56,0:19:05.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经是总统了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you already president?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.90,0:19:08.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是和大家聊了一聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm. I've just been talking to people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.60,0:19:10.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耶稣今早离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus left this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.39,0:19:12.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他让我和你说一声来着  但我忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me to tell you, but I-I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.77,0:19:15.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  等下次吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.64,0:19:17.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去拿点牛奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get some milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.77,0:19:19.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-让我去吧  -不用  我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me. - No, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.31,0:19:29.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.27,0:19:32.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耶稣的事你没对玛姬说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lying to Maggie about Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.13,0:19:36.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.89,0:19:38.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个住在房子里的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}A girl who lives in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.48,0:19:39.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她给我介绍了所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was telling me about everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.68,0:19:41.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说耶稣是个侦察者\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said Jesus is a runner
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.43,0:19:42.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他昨天就走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that he left yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.71,0:19:44.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是今早\N{\fnArial\fs30}not this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.95,0:19:49.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 骗她是为她好  - 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's for her own good. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.94,0:19:51.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我必须做点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I need to do something,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.41,0:19:54.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而她肯定想帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she'll want to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.56,0:19:57.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想杀尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to kill Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.85,0:20:05.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是你有帮手呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if you have help?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.28,0:20:08.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是有帮手  很多人手\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we had help -- a lot of people...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.38,0:20:09.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就不怕告诉她真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I wouldn't be afraid to tell her,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.78,0:20:11.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为她知道她不用管\N{\fnArial\fs30}because she'd know it wasn't on her to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.66,0:20:15.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-但如果只有我  那么...  -不是只有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But if it's just me, then... - ‭It isn't just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.07,0:20:16.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和玛姬不是唯一\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Maggie aren't the only ones
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.54,0:20:17.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想干掉尼根的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who want to take Negan out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.75,0:20:18.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-还有...  -不  伊妮德\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's... - ‭No, Enid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.91,0:20:20.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.26,0:20:21.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你真关心她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you care about her,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.34,0:20:23.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就什么都不要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't say anything about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.92,0:20:27.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须保护她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to keep her safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.84,0:20:30.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须保护她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to keep her safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.38,0:20:35.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是只有你一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.02,0:20:40.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少看起来只有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sure looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.70,0:20:45.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灾变后出现了很多聚居点\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of places came together after the world fell apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.41,0:20:49.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你俩都是从某个聚居点过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you're both from one of those places.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.92,0:20:53.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些社区和营地多数都已经消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of those communities and camps are gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.49,0:20:57.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我失去了很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.95,0:21:01.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我几乎对人们失去希望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pretty much lost hope in people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.47,0:21:04.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但后来我找到了神之国\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then I found the Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.23,0:21:07.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见到了以西结\N{\fnArial\fs30}I met Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.42,0:21:10.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到了他建立的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw what he built.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.18,0:21:13.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但现在我认为他建立的王国受到了威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now I believe what he built is under threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.60,0:21:16.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-救世军  -救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Saviors. - The Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.89,0:21:19.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几个月前\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few months back,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.69,0:21:22.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以西结和几个护卫在林子里遇到他们一队人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezekiel and a few guards met a group of them in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.83,0:21:26.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救世军承认以西结的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Saviors recognized Ezekiel's capabilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.40,0:21:28.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以西结也不想跟他们打\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Ezekiel didn't want to fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.55,0:21:29.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以他们定了个协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}so they cut a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.08,0:21:32.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以食物和补给品\N{\fnArial\fs30}In exchange for food and supplies,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.00,0:21:33.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换取他们不伤人\N{\fnArial\fs30}no one would get hurt,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.40,0:21:35.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不踏入神之国一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they'd never set foot inside the Kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.02,0:21:37.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事知道的人很少\N{\fnArial\fs30}and very few of us even know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.89,0:21:39.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这跟我有什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does any of this have to do with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.17,0:21:42.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道以西结欣赏你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know Ezekiel likes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.89,0:21:45.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也知道以西结信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also know that Ezekiel trusts you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.13,0:21:46.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我才来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.84,0:21:49.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你们帮我说服他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to help me convince him of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.23,0:21:51.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  我们跟救世军保持着和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, we have peace with the Saviors,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.33,0:21:54.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但早晚会出事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but sooner or later, sometimes's gonna go wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.73,0:21:56.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是某次贡品少了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we'll be light on a drop,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.97,0:21:59.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是我们的人不小心冒犯了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}or maybe one of ours will look at one of theirs the wrong way,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.48,0:22:04.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者他们干脆决定不再遵守协定\N{\fnArial\fs30}or maybe they'll just decide to stop honoring the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.52,0:22:07.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总会出事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things will go bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.91,0:22:09.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一旦出事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when they do...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.93,0:22:14.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神之国就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...the Kingdom will fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.35,0:22:20.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有过家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.19,0:22:23.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灾变夺走了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost it to this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.03,0:22:26.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我目睹了家人死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw them die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.60,0:22:31.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怕如果我们现在不做些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm scared that, if we don't do something now,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.77,0:22:34.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不只会失去更多人  我们还会失去一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we won't only lose more people -- we'll lose everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.28,0:22:38.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我了解救世军  知道他们的所作所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what the Saviors are, and I know what they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.03,0:22:41.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更知道他们不值得信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know they cannot be trusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.85,0:22:46.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你们也知道这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think you know that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.71,0:22:50.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想让我们做些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly are you asking?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.96,0:22:54.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想让你们帮我劝以西结\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm asking you to help convince Ezekiel
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.86,0:22:58.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对救世军先下手为强\N{\fnArial\fs30}to attack the Saviors, to strike first...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.05,0:23:00.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灭掉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.47,0:23:11.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是为自己准备的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.44,0:23:14.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}or Negan?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.31,0:23:19.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.73,0:23:22.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}How will you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.39,0:23:26.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要扣下扳机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.60,0:23:28.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.00,0:23:31.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要他先死就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as he goes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.41,0:23:34.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么非要送死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you have to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.55,0:23:37.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他必须死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he has to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.96,0:23:44.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我赞同\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.00,0:23:46.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.07,0:23:53.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你要陪他死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.17,0:23:58.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.03,0:24:02.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以完全对我坦白\N{\fnArial\fs30}No need to lie to me if...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.23,0:24:06.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这是我们最后一次谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is our last conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.59,0:24:14.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果亚伯拉罕还活着  我们就能战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Abraham was alive, we could fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.09,0:24:18.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果格伦还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Glenn was,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.57,0:24:23.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬的孩子就有父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie's kid would have a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.25,0:24:28.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米琼恩和卡尔可以战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michonne and Carl can fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.18,0:24:31.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们有瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.19,0:24:35.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚伦有埃里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaron has Eric.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.89,0:24:39.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤金知识丰富\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene knows things.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.26,0:24:42.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔很强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl's strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.60,0:24:46.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨沙呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Sasha?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.65,0:25:03.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着我  罗西塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me, Rosita.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.36,0:25:11.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不该是你去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}It shouldn't have been you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.96,0:25:14.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁都不该去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}It shouldn't have been anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.84,0:25:18.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会胜利的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll win,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.05,0:25:22.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们要等待合适的时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we need to wait for the right moment
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.20,0:25:24.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或是大家一起...\N{\fnArial\fs30}or create it...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.33,0:25:27.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,创造时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}together.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.29,0:25:31.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我们以后抗争的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're a part of that together.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.27,0:25:36.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.51,0:25:42.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.73,0:26:43.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我知道他们人很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. I know there's a lot of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.03,0:26:46.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜比神之国的人还多很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing a good deal more than we have at the Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.64,0:26:48.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出其不意是我们的唯一希望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The element of surprise is our only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.92,0:26:50.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得先出击\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to attack first,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.21,0:26:53.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趁着我们还有优势  现在就行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we need to do it now while we still have the advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.40,0:26:58.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝尔  我估计那种暴力和争斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol, I imagine that violence and fighting
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.74,0:27:00.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你并没有经历过\N{\fnArial\fs30}is something you haven't been a part of.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.81,0:27:02.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.12,0:27:04.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你大错特错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're very wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.63,0:27:07.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她可能是这屋子里最强的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's probably the most capable fighter in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.88,0:27:09.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是时候反抗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it's time to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.56,0:27:12.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.16,0:27:15.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想参与这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is something I am not a part of.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.99,0:27:17.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就不用战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you don't have to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.21,0:27:18.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只用说服以西结\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just have to convince Ezekiel
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.59,0:27:20.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带领神之国反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to bring the Kingdom to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.14,0:27:22.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没懂我意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not understanding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.89,0:27:23.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.92,0:27:26.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想要以西结或是摩根来这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want Ezekiel or Morgan coming here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.57,0:27:30.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的死活与我没有任何关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't want anything to do with your lives or your deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.12,0:27:32.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想一个人待着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to be left alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.08,0:27:42.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们会死  很多人会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}People will die -- a lot of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.26,0:27:44.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你杀过一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.07,0:27:46.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我杀人是为了救人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took a life to save a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.09,0:27:48.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么该死的区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the same goddamn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.47,0:27:50.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们杀他们也是为了自救\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be taking their lives to save ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.20,0:27:51.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是你不知道能不能成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only you don't know that it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.76,0:27:54.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总有一天你会选择杀人的  摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna choose to kill one day, Morgan,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.55,0:27:56.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为早晚会到那一步的\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause it will get that bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.41,0:28:00.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何不现在就做出选择呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not choose now,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.33,0:28:03.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在失去你关心的人之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}before you lose someone you care about?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.44,0:28:05.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在是和平的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a peace now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.02,0:28:07.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想去改变它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't be a part of changing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.67,0:28:09.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们可以促进和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}And maybe we can build on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.46,0:28:11.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是和这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not with these people!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.22,0:28:12.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当他们反咬一口的时候  他们一定会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they turn on us -- and they will --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.83,0:28:14.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的双手将沾满鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}that blood is gonna be on your hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.25,0:28:22.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但也许你们俩早就习惯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But maybe you're both used to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.82,0:28:29.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should go, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.90,0:28:30.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.54,0:28:36.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不希望任何人来这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want anyone else coming around
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.34,0:28:38.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不希望别人知道我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}or even knowing where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.28,0:28:40.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你遇到我们认识的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you somehow see anyone we know,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.54,0:28:41.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉他们我不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell them I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.54,0:28:44.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请你帮我这个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do that for me please.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.17,0:28:46.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从来没想让你看到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never meant for you to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.23,0:29:38.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.63,0:29:41.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.39,0:29:46.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.85,0:30:04.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(禁止野营)
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.44,0:31:11.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去赴约吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hot date?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.74,0:31:17.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们对我印象不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on a good momentum with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.15,0:31:18.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要利用这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna try to use that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.17,0:31:20.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.00,0:31:25.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,试图靠近他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}By trying to get closer,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.89,0:31:27.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即便只是刚开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}even just to start trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.59,0:31:29.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我能做到  一段时间后\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I can do that, after a while --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.04,0:31:31.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许几个月  也许几年\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe months, maybe years --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.30,0:31:32.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后也许会有转机\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe then we try something.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.82,0:31:36.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认为我妈就会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's what my mom would have done,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.43,0:31:38.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我也要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}so it's what I'm gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.46,0:31:42.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.71,0:31:48.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管之前那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it was...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.43,0:31:51.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为我们曾有过美好的感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we had something good --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.15,0:31:54.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少是美好感情的开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}at least, the beginning of something good.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.80,0:31:55.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要结束它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you end it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.14,0:31:59.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那又为什么要开始呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you even start it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.08,0:32:05.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时想忘记一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying not to think about shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.33,0:32:10.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很可爱  个子又高\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're cute, tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.09,0:32:13.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候挺温柔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sweet sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.87,0:32:17.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我利用了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I used you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.10,0:32:26.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.37,0:32:32.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你待会来吃晚餐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you be up for dinner later?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.95,0:32:36.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是吃晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really mean just dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.84,0:32:38.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没别的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭No strings.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.58,0:32:43.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.35,0:32:45.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.05,0:33:08.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.35,0:33:19.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都好  我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cool, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.23,0:33:22.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥们  你可以从后门走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy, you can walk right out that back gate there,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.04,0:33:24.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我什么都不会说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I won't say anything to anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.85,0:33:26.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本该在那里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm supposed to be there now,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.78,0:33:31.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但听着  我只是想活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, listen, I'm -- I'm just trying to get by,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.65,0:33:32.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.42,0:33:36.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.81,0:33:39.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.04,0:33:50.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.79,0:34:09.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不是只想活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't just about gettin' by here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.65,0:34:12.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是想得到一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about gettin' it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.41,0:34:17.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我拿到钥匙了  走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the key. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.91,0:34:21.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我只是想跟他说说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, ‭I just want to talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.56,0:34:22.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said "No."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.79,0:34:25.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别无礼  阿拉特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dot be an asshole, Arat.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.71,0:34:27.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the man pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.15,0:34:37.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死  这是给我的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap. Is that for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.56,0:34:40.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还没正式见过面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't officially met.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.57,0:34:42.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫斯宾塞·门罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Spencer Monroe.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.35,0:34:45.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.05,0:35:00.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼根就在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.49,0:35:14.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在那下面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.97,0:35:16.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.34,0:35:19.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都是尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.74,0:35:24.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管你想做什么  都行不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you're trying to do, you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.47,0:35:27.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你还是有选择的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you still have some choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.85,0:35:29.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.37,0:35:34.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烧了这辆车  沉进湖里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn this car, roll it down into a lake,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.17,0:35:35.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让它消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}make it disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.31,0:35:39.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贮物箱里有个消声器\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a silencer in the glove compartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.58,0:36:43.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.90,0:36:44.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼根吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.60,0:36:47.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你屋里  混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in your house, asshole,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.87,0:36:49.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.25,0:37:00.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样进去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.81,0:37:02.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们等了你好几个小时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, we've been waiting for hours
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.97,0:37:05.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就想看看你能交给我们什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to see what you gonna bring us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.66,0:37:09.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如我们先看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we have a look first?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.52,0:37:15.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自来水  空调\N{\fnArial\fs30}Running water, air conditioning,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.87,0:37:18.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有乔迁贺礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}a housewarming gift?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.29,0:37:20.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这么定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That settles it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.07,0:37:23.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要在这里搞个度假屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am getting myself a vacation home here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.03,0:37:25.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为此干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheers to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.45,0:37:35.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这酒不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.50,0:37:38.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看  就差一张台球桌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the only thing missing is a pool table.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.77,0:37:41.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有比一场精彩的八球比赛更棒的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing better than a good game of 8 ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.10,0:37:46.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,街对面那栋房子的车库里有一张\N{\fnArial\fs30}The house across the street has one in the garage.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.10,0:37:48.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯宾塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Spencer,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.08,0:37:52.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我新的好朋友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you may just be my new best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.30,0:37:55.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天天气这么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a nice day, though --
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.82,0:37:56.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还窝在车库里\N{\fnArial\fs30}too nice to be cooped up
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.93,0:37:59.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不合适  你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}inside some garage, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.00,0:38:01.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.24,0:38:04.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有一个更棒的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I got a better idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.31,0:38:15.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.86,0:38:18.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走了很远\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had to go out pretty far.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.01,0:38:21.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这他妈是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.20,0:38:24.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜你赢了  但你还是输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Congrats for winning. But you still lose"?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.98,0:38:32.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我们留了封小情书吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You leave us a little love note?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.34,0:38:35.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是  我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I just --
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.67,0:38:39.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  我们不会这样做的  显然不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean -- We wouldn't, obviously --
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.44,0:38:40.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.61,0:38:42.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才是说这是显然的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you just say it's obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.80,0:38:47.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,字条不是我们留的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.86,0:38:50.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说的不是这张该死的字条\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not about the damn note!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.25,0:38:51.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.43,0:38:54.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去见尼根  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run along to Negan, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.98,0:39:03.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你这位朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}But your friend here --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.90,0:39:05.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他没有地方可去\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's got no place to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.72,0:39:08.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你  -后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You -- - ‭Back up!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.50,0:39:13.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不可能和瑞克玩这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could never do this with Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.95,0:39:17.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他只会站在那  皱着眉\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would just be standing there, scowling,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.32,0:39:21.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用讨厌的眼神斜视我\N{\fnArial\fs30}giving me that annoying side-eye he gives me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.40,0:39:23.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实这才是我来找你的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's actually what I came to see you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.26,0:39:26.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想和你说说瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to talk to you about Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.05,0:39:34.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.18,0:39:36.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说吧  斯宾塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me, Spencer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.38,0:39:39.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和我说说瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me about Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.15,0:39:49.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白你想要在这做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get what you're trying to do here,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.09,0:39:51.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想建造什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what you're trying to build.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.90,0:39:53.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我并不是说我赞同你的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying I agree with your methods,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.25,0:39:55.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.45,0:39:56.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在搭建网络\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're building a network.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.67,0:39:59.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让大家为集体做贡献\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're making people contribute for the greater good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.61,0:40:01.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.72,0:40:05.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你应该知道瑞克·格兰姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you should know that Rick Grimes
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.53,0:40:08.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前就不能很好的和他人共事\N{\fnArial\fs30}has a history of not working well with others.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.38,0:40:13.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.43,0:40:19.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里原来不是瑞克管事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick wasn't the original leader here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.35,0:40:20.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom was.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.76,0:40:23.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她当时做得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was doing a really good job of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.95,0:40:28.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克出现后不久  她就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then she died, not long after Rick showed up --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.71,0:40:30.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我兄弟也死了  我爸爸也死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}same with my brother, same with my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.11,0:40:35.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说  这些年这里一直欢乐美满\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, everything was peachy here for -- what -- years?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.64,0:40:39.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克出现后  突然之间你就成了孤儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then Rick shows up, and suddenly, you're an orphan?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.22,0:40:43.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我听过的最悲惨的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the saddest story I've ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.46,0:40:49.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好在他不再管事了  -这不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good thing for you ‭he's not in charge anymore. - Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.45,0:40:51.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他自负得无法控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}His ego's out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.53,0:40:53.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他总能找到办法搞砸事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll find a way to screw things up,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.70,0:40:55.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,按他自己的想法行事  接管一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}to try and do things his way, to take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.96,0:40:59.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就是这么对我妈妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what he did with my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.49,0:41:00.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还会重蹈覆辙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what he'll do again.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.33,0:41:12.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么你到底想怎么做呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly are you proposing be done about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.90,0:41:15.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是我妈妈的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am my mother's son.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.48,0:41:18.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以成为像她一样的领导者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can be the leader she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.02,0:41:21.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这正是这个地方需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what this place needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.34,0:41:22.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是你需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.10,0:41:27.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我应该让你管事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I should put you in charge
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.68,0:41:29.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是这个意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's what you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.25,0:41:31.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那样对我们都更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd be much better off.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.85,0:41:38.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事  你没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all right. You're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.72,0:41:41.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.71,0:41:42.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他学会教训了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point made.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.34,0:41:54.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的心还在跳  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}My heart's still beating, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.88,0:42:04.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实  斯宾塞  我在考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I'm thinking, Spencer.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.98,0:42:07.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想到瑞克之前威胁要杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking how Rick threatened to kill me,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.28,0:42:10.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以及他显然恨我入骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}how he clearly hates my guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.35,0:42:13.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他现在在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he is out there right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.03,0:42:16.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,替我搜集物资  以确保\N{\fnArial\fs30}gathering shit for me to make sure
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.80,0:42:20.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会杀了任何住在这里的好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't hurt any of the fine people that live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.70,0:42:24.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他把仇恨都咽进肚子里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is swallowing his hate
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.79,0:42:27.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真正替我办了事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and getting shit done.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.88,0:42:31.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是需要勇气的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That takes guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.08,0:42:40.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then there's you...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.69,0:42:46.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等着瑞克走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the guy who waited for Rick to be gone
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.02,0:42:48.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼鬼祟祟跑过来找我谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}so he could sneak over and talk to me
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.36,0:42:50.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要借我的刀杀人  \N{\fnArial\fs30}to get me to do his dirty work,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.07,0:42:52.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好取代瑞克的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}so he could take Rick's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.92,0:42:54.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我不得不问问\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I got to ask --
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.95,0:42:56.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想取代瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you wanna take over,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.11,0:43:03.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何不自己动手杀了他  然后取而代之呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}why not just kill Rick yourself and just take over?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.25,0:43:03.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  不  不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.87,0:43:05.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有  我不是那个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't -- I don't --
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.34,0:43:06.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我是怎么想的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I'm thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.97,0:43:09.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我大概猜到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I have a guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.29,0:43:17.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你没胆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's because you got no guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.15,0:43:41.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真尴尬\N{\fnArial\fs30}How embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.06,0:43:44.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然有呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.28,0:43:46.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的胆子一直在你的身体里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were inside you the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.21,0:43:47.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是有胆的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did have guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.59,0:43:50.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我这辈子错得最离谱的一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never been so wrong in my whole life!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.04,0:44:17.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快过来个人  把血污都清理干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, someone oughta get up here and clean this mess up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.20,0:44:29.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人想接替他打完这一局吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone want to finish the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.70,0:44:31.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}C'mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.46,0:44:35.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.35,0:44:38.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.97,0:44:42.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}C'mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.13,0:44:45.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都快赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was winning!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.46,0:44:59.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.08,0:45:01.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the shit?!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.44,0:45:06.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的  你想杀了老子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit! You just -- You tried to kill me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.25,0:45:08.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你打中了露西尔  -她碍事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You shot Lucille! - She got in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.01,0:45:23.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.83,0:45:28.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.72,0:45:31.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这玩意儿是手工做出来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This little bad boy made from scratch?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.06,0:45:34.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧这折痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at those crimps.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.41,0:45:36.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是手工做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was homemade.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.12,0:45:39.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你或许很愚蠢  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may be stupid, darlin',
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.86,0:45:43.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你显示出非凡的创造力\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you showed some real ingenuity here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.37,0:45:45.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿拉特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arat,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.36,0:45:50.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把刀移到那姑娘的脸上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}move that knife up out on that girl's face.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.75,0:45:56.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,露西尔美丽光滑的脸庞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucille's beautiful, smooth surface
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.10,0:45:58.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再也不会想以前那样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is never gonna look the same,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.24,0:46:00.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凭什么你的脸可以美丽光滑\N{\fnArial\fs30}so why should yours?!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.01,0:46:03.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.94,0:46:10.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非你告诉我这是谁做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you tell me who made this.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.95,0:46:12.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.24,0:46:14.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.08,0:46:18.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, now I just think you're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.44,0:46:22.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到了现在还敢对我撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you lying to me now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.29,0:46:26.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.92,0:46:29.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿拉特只能割花你美丽的小脸蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arat's gonna have to cut up that pretty face.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.29,0:46:32.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再答一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more try.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.04,0:46:34.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.88,0:46:41.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可真硬气啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are such a badass!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.59,0:46:45.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.60,0:46:48.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就顺了你的意吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.98,0:46:50.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿拉特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arat...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.31,0:46:52.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.51,0:46:56.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要  是我做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It was me!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.18,0:46:57.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.17,0:47:19.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们达成了协议的  -瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We had an agreement. - Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.43,0:47:22.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家瞧啊  瑞克来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, everybody, it's Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.61,0:47:27.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的人逼我这么吼来吼去的  嗓子都哑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, your people are making me lose my voice doin' all this yelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.39,0:47:32.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克  对我说句谢谢怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick... how about a "Thank you"?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.99,0:47:38.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我们这段关系的初始\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look, I know we started this relationship
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.86,0:47:42.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我敲烂了你朋友们的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}with me beating the holy shit out of your friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.47,0:47:44.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因此我们永远不可能友好地坐下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and because of that, we're never gonna sit around
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.21,0:47:45.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给对方编辫子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and braid each other's hair
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.29,0:47:47.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或是互相倾吐内心最深处最黑暗的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}or share our deepest, darkest secrets,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.64,0:47:50.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你能不能有点感恩之心\N{\fnArial\fs30}but how about a little credit?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.24,0:47:55.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我苦心孤诣地向你展示  我是个多么讲道理的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just bent over backwards to show you how reasonable I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.44,0:47:57.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your kid --
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.28,0:48:00.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他藏在我的一辆卡车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}he hid in one of my trucks
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.40,0:48:03.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用冲锋枪扫倒了我的一堆手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}and machine-gunned a bunch of my men down,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.52,0:48:07.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还把他安全带回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I brought him home, safe and sound,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.89,0:48:10.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给他做了意面吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I fed him spaghetti.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.09,0:48:17.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,另一个你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another one of your people --
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.41,0:48:23.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想要我杀了你  让他取而代之\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, he wanted me to kill you and put him in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.02,0:48:26.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为你...干掉了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took him out...for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.45,0:48:29.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,另一个人  这位\N{\fnArial\fs30}And another one, here --
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.46,0:48:34.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她击中了露西尔  刚才想杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}she shot Lucille, trying to kill me just now,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.78,0:48:37.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我又帮你减少了一张要养活的嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I gave you one less mouth to feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.56,0:48:39.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧她那样儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by looking at her --
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.26,0:48:42.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那张嘴可吃了不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}that mouth did some major damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.20,0:48:43.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,个人来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, personally,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.67,0:48:45.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会选择杀她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't have picked her to be the one to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.50,0:48:46.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是阿拉特\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Arat --
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.01,0:48:49.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  不太信任她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know -- didn't trust her.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.01,0:49:00.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的东西在大门那里放着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your shit's waiting for you at the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.43,0:49:01.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.05,0:49:05.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然可以  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure thing, Rick...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.53,0:49:09.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我找出造这颗子弹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}right after I find the guy or gal
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.27,0:49:12.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男人或女人之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}that made this bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.38,0:49:14.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿拉特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arat?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.55,0:49:18.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was me!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.29,0:49:22.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.33,0:49:32.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.48,0:49:36.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was only me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.58,0:49:37.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.45,0:49:44.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,需要空弹壳  四孔转动装弹器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It required one spent casing, one four-holed turret reloader,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.33,0:49:46.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,火药  火药漏斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}powder, one funnel for the powder --
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.38,0:49:47.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.60,0:49:51.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.20,0:50:09.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,露西尔  给我力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucille, give me strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.04,0:50:19.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要带走你的子弹制造者  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be relieving you of your bullet maker, Rick --
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.06,0:50:23.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以及你在前门给我留下的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}that and whatever you left for me at the front gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.25,0:50:28.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管你搜集到了多少东西  都不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}And however much you scavenged, it's not good enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.01,0:50:30.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为在今天的事后\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you're still in
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.74,0:50:34.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你仍然处在深深的\N{\fnArial\fs30}a serious, serious hole
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.21,0:50:35.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无底洞中\N{\fnArial\fs30}after today.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.92,0:50:41.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.13,0:50:46.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.08,0:50:47.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了  只带走我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, just take me!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.73,0:50:48.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.21,0:50:51.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克  我不会撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, I ain't gonna lie --
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.85,0:50:55.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的厨房一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}your kitchen is a goddamn mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.52,0:50:59.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.65,0:52:03.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔告诉我你在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl told me you were in here. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.57,0:52:31.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找到了我想找的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found what I was looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.57,0:52:39.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我之前想跟你和亚伦一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to go with you and Aaron,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.74,0:52:43.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.19,0:52:46.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须找到自己的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to go my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.30,0:52:49.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我找到时\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when I found it...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.17,0:52:53.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}...I realized that...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.02,0:52:58.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不希望那只是我的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want it to be my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.16,0:53:04.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望那是我们的  我和你的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted it to be ours -- me and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.80,0:53:14.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们有更多人  比我们想的还多\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are more of them, even more than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.00,0:53:17.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敌众我寡  相去甚远\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are outnumbered. It's not even close.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.54,0:53:22.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这不能改变我的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that doesn't change the way that I feel,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.65,0:53:25.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这不会改变事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}because it doesn't change the way that things are.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.67,0:53:27.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们依然活着  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still alive, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.65,0:53:30.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生了那么多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much has happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.42,0:53:32.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么多我们本不可能挺过去的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}so much that we shouldn't have lived through.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.76,0:53:34.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而\N{\fnArial\fs30}And...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.19,0:53:36.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管与此无关还是正因为如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in spite of it or maybe because of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.54,0:53:38.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都活下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.96,0:53:43.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还在这里  我们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still here, the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.75,0:53:49.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还活着  而且我们会继续活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still standing, and we're gonna keep standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.48,0:53:51.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们该对此做些什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do we do with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.34,0:53:56.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们如何让活着更有意义呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we make that mean something?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.26,0:54:01.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是能做成事的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the ones who get things done.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.83,0:54:03.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.13,0:54:07.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是能活下去的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the ones who live.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.20,0:54:14.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们更需要战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we have to fight --
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.82,0:54:17.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是为了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}not for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.13,0:54:21.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是为了朱迪思  为了卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}but for Judith, for Carl,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.78,0:54:25.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了亚历山大  为了山顶寨\N{\fnArial\fs30}for Alexandria, for the Hilltop --
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.00,0:54:27.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.80,0:54:32.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能抗争他们  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can fight them, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.84,0:54:35.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能找到战胜他们的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can find a way to beat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.42,0:54:38.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.87,0:54:42.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.26,0:54:46.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.98,0:54:49.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only if...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.91,0:54:55.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起做\N{\fnArial\fs30}we do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.46,0:55:04.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我现在知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.20,0:55:13.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.17,0:56:25.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨沙  伊妮德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sasha! Enid!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.20,0:56:42.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你没事吧  - 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're okay?  - I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.39,0:56:44.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The baby's okay --
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.68,0:56:46.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.74,0:56:49.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.35,0:56:53.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从一开始就是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}right from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.68,0:56:56.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你告诉我们要准备抗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told us to get ready to fight.
